# Every compiled shared object is build output. Listed as a blanket pattern
# rather than one path per module because a DIRECTORY RENAME silently
# un-ignores a path-specific entry: #318 renamed brainray/ to rayrot/ and
# moved this line with it, which left anyone holding a pre-rename
# brainray/raylib.so with a suddenly-unignored 49KB binary that `git add`
# swept straight into a commit (caught in review on #324).
*.so
# Generated raylib binding (Road B, issue #208): adapters, prelude, ABI check
# and their build products. Derived from rayrot/raylib_api.json, which IS
# committed -- see roadmap Appendix B Q7 for why the input is a source file
# and the output is not. Regenerate with `make rayrot-gen-sources`.
rayrot/generated/
__pycache__/
brainrot.wasm
brainrot.mjs
tests/brainrot-test.wasm
tests/brainrot-test.mjs
tests/abi/struct_layout_abi_check
tests/arena/arena_check
